  "instructions": [
    "Wrap a large sheet of baking parchment around a bamboo sushi mat to prevent sticking.",
    "Spread a thin layer of sesame oil on the parchment.",
    "Place 1/2 cup of cooked brown rice at the bottom of the parchment, leaving a 1-inch border around the edges.",
    "Place 1/4 cup of chopped kimchi next to the rice.",
    "Place 1/2 cup of sliced zucchini, cucumber, and carrot on top of the kimchi.",
    "Place 2 slices of tempeh on top of the vegetables.",
    "Brush the tempeh with sesame oil and sprinkle with Korean chili flakes.",
    "Place 1/4 cup of green onions on top of the tempeh.",
    "Roll the gimbap by lifting the edge of the parchment and applying gentle pressure.",
    "Cut the gimbap into 8 equal pieces using a sharp knife."
  ],
